10	//! failure here; a mis-tiled rank deployment hangs in DeepEP's collective
11	//! `ctx_create` and every process dies on its device timeout. A restarted
12	//! process re-fetches the SAME id (the serve side is idempotent — the whole
13	//! fleet restarts together under fate-sharing, so the id never rotates).
